---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import familyField from '../assets/family-field.jpg';
---

<section id="fit">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="kicker">Honest fit check</span>
    <h2>Is this your season?</h2>
    <p class="lede"
      >We'd rather be honest than take your money. This works when it's the right
      time.</p
    >
    <div class="fit-grid">
      <div class="fit-card yes rv">
        <h3>Built for you if</h3>
        <ul>
          <li
            >You want to <strong>lose fat and keep your muscle</strong>, without
            punishing yourself to do it</li
          >
          <li
            >You're postpartum, or in any caregiving season where the week rarely
            goes to plan</li
          >
          <li
            >You're nursing and <strong>at least 3 months</strong> postpartum.
            Supply-aware coaching is the point.</li
          >
          <li
            >You'll track food for a season so you can <strong
              >stop tracking for good</strong
            ></li
          >
          <li
            >You want a human reading your week, not just an algorithm scoring it</li
          >
          <li
            >Your kitchen runs on animal protein, or pescatarian or vegetarian
            patterns</li
          >
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="fit-card notyet rv">
        <h3>Not yet if</h3>
        <ul>
          <li
            ><strong>You're pregnant.</strong> That's an abundance season, not a
            cut. <a href="/quiz">See the quiz</a> for a gentle next step — start
            the program after.</li
          >
          <li
            ><strong
              >You're nursing, under 3 months, and it doesn't feel right yet.</strong
            >
            {' '}Some mamas are ready this early; it depends on how your body
            feels, and Callie makes that call with you.</li
          >
          <li
            >You want a crash diet. We will make you eat more. It won't be a fit.</li
          >
          <li
            >Your kitchen is fully vegan. Our playbook leans on animal protein,
            and honesty beats a refund request.</li
          >
          <li
            >You're navigating an active eating disorder without your provider's
            clearance.</li
          >
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="fam-banner rv">
      <div class="frame">
        <Image
          src={familyField}
          alt="Callie, Patrick, their two boys, and Maple the dog in front of the Golden Gate Bridge"
          widths={[640, 900, 1400]}
          sizes="(max-width: 880px) 92vw, 900px"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
      <p class="fam-caption"
        ><span class="script"
          >The whole operation: Callie, The Tech Guy, two boys, and Maple.</span
        ></p
      >
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
